# Known credential sites, recorded 2026-08-17 by the first security audit.
#
# This is DEBT, not permission. Every line is the server's admin password in a
# PUBLIC repository. The check passes on these so CI is not permanently red, and
# fails on any NEW site -- the point is to stop the problem growing while it is
# being fixed.
#
# Fixing it means rotating the credential AND deleting the line here. Rotating
# alone leaves the check blind to a re-commit of the old value.
#
# format: <path>:<pattern>
docs/plans/gui-verification-pass.md:headless2pw
